  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethnic Conflict in Burma, National Peace Building</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Etniska konflikter i Burma, Nationellt Fredsbyggan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the ethnic crises in Burma by giving a voice to ethnic    minority groups in Burma Exp results: 1) Provide space for strategic  thinking for ethnic groups from Burma (inside and outside)             2) Build capacity of ethnic political parties and civil society in   key policy areas                                                       3) Promote ethnic peace as a national issue in the country</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att ta itu med de etniska kriserna i Burma genom att ge en r&#xf6;st &#xe5;t etniska minoritetsgrupper i Burma Exp resultat: 1) Ge utrymme f&#xf6;r strategiskt t&#xe4;nkande f&#xf6;r etniska grupper fr&#xe5;n Burma (inuti och utanf&#xf6;r) 2) Bygg kapacitet hos etniska politiska partier och civilsamh&#xe4;llet i nyckelpolitik omr&#xe5;den 3) Fr&#xe4;mja etnisk fred som en nationell fr&#xe5;ga i landet</narrative>
  </description>
